<%- include('../../partials/header', { title }) %>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600">绑定成功</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      <%= session.provider === 'anthropic' ? 'Claude' : 'Codex' %> 订阅已绑定
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
      凭证文件已经保存到该用户的私有 HOME 目录(权限 700)。平台之后调用 LLM 时会以这个 HOME 作为
      <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1 text-xs">$HOME</code> 启动子进程,直接复用你的订阅,无需 API key。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex gap-3">
      <a
        href="/account/credentials"
        class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-slate-700"
      >查看我的凭证</a>
      <a
        href="/account/oauth/start"
        class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100"
      >再绑定一个</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
